    "versionedCompletedClinical": "Stale base versions conflict; no automatic clinical merge; no blind LWW.",
    "editableDemographicDraft": "Worker-confirmable resolution allowed for demographic draft fields only.",
    "versionedRecord": "Version check required; conflict persisted for controlled resolution."
